content:
imo get Saya first, arguably strongest character in the game. Then you can either go for:
Saya wheel: broken as fuck, +1 arithmetica permanently, and a shit ton of corrosion;
Horla: very strong support, and very cheap "use one card and forget she exists";
Mouchette: very strong damage dealer, specialized in bossfights and dying (you or the boss, whoever goes down first);
